    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I am still living in the memory. Make more memories...",
      "translation" : "我還活在回憶裡。創造更多回憶吧..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊順]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh are you level 140 yet? I won't talk to any weak adventurers.",
      "translation" : "哦，你到140級了嗎？我不和弱小的冒險者說話。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊順]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When I was a young girl many years ago there was a man who I had crush on. I didn't know to tell him how I felt...",
      "translation" : "很多年前，我還是個年輕女孩時，曾經喜歡上一個男人。我不知道該怎麼告訴他我的心意..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊順]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I used to tease his Peco Peco and wanted him to notice that I was interested. This went on and on for a while.",
      "translation" : "我總是捉弄他的大嘴鳥，希望他能注意到我對他的好感。這樣的日子持續了很久。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊順]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Then we started dating somehow. It's still embarrasing to talk about it.",
      "translation" : "後來我們不知怎麼就開始交往了。現在說起這事還是挺難為情的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊順]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Anyway, we got married when we became old enough to marry. He used to say sorry for not being able to afford to buy a ring for me.",
      "translation" : "後來我們到了適婚年齡，就結婚了。他總為買不起戒指送我而道歉。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊順]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It has been 40 years since we were married and he still says ^0000ff'Darling~ Do you want to have a ring?'^000000.",
      "translation" : "我們結婚已經40年了，他還總是說^0000ff“親愛的~你想要一枚戒指嗎？”^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊順]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I told him.. What good is a ring for an old lady?",
      "translation" : "我告訴他...老太婆要戒指有什麼用？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊順]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I should have stopped him. I still remember his face early.",
      "translation" : "我真該攔住他的。我還清楚記得他當時的表情。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What happened to him?",
      "translation" : "他怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊順]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "He had not came back since he left home to buy a ring.",
      "translation" : "他離家去買戒指後，就再也沒有回來。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffThe old lady turned her face down with reddened eyes.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff老婦人低下了頭，眼眶泛紅。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Stop talking.",
      "translation" : "結束對話"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Show the ring from the Faceworm's Nest.",
      "translation" : "展示來自驚駭森靈巢穴的戒指"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊順]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What about this ring?",
      "translation" : "這枚戒指怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊順]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh... Darling~",
      "translation" : "哦...親愛的~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffThe lady read an inscription inside the ring and started weeping.",
      "translation" : "^0000ff老婦人讀著戒指內側的刻字，開始哭泣。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun, my darling flower]^000000",
      "translation" : "[俊順，我親愛的花兒]^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffYou sense a warm energy emanating. Maybe this is the wish of the man who made this ring.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff你感受到一股溫暖的力量散發出來。也許這是製作這枚戒指的男人的心願。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The warm energy has inspired you with strength.",
      "translation" : "溫暖的能量讓你渾身充滿力量。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The lady keeps crying over and over holding a ring. It seems to be no use talking to her right now.",
      "translation" : "老婦人緊握著戒指，淚流不止。現在還是別打擾她了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sadly, this woman does not seem to remember the past because of abrupt emotional changes. Let's talk carefully and listen to her story.",
      "translation" : "遺憾的是，老婦人情緒起伏太大，似乎又記不清往事了。小心地與她交談，聽聽她的故事吧。"
    },
    {
