      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞爾吉奧]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Fortune or fame is not important. The most important thing is family.",
      "translation" : "財富和名聲都不重要，最重要的是家人。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞爾吉奧]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Are you at least level 140 yet?",
      "translation" : "你至少達到140級了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞爾吉奧]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I have a blurry memory of when I used to travel with my father's armed-merchant group.",
      "translation" : "我依稀記得，自己曾跟隨父親的武裝商團四處旅行。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞爾吉奧]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I vaguely remember everyone of the group were scattered after being attacked by a giant snake-like creature.",
      "translation" : "我模糊地記得，商團遭到一隻巨蛇襲擊後，所有人都四散逃開了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞爾吉奧]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I had lost my family at that time. I do not clearly remember even their faces.",
      "translation" : "那時我失去了家人，甚至連他們的長相都記不清了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞爾吉奧]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now I've made my own armed-merchant group and got my life back. But the memory of my past keeps haunting me.",
      "translation" : "如今我組建了自己的武裝商團，生活也重新步入正軌。可過去的記憶仍然糾纏著我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞爾吉奧]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I just stopped by this town to possibly find a record of my family and the armed-merchant group but so far I've found nothing.",
      "translation" : "我只是順道來鎮上，想找找家人和武裝商團的記錄，但至今一無所獲。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Stop talking.",
      "translation" : "結束對話"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Show him the Old Photo Album",
      "translation" : "給他看陳舊的相簿"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞爾吉奧]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes! I remembered. This is the one who used to work for my father's armed-merchant group.",
      "translation" : "是的！我想起來了。這人以前在我父親的武裝商團工作。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞爾吉奧]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh my... There are other pictures here too...",
      "translation" : "天哪...這裡還有其他照片..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffA smile of lonely satisfaction spreads over the face of Sergio while looking at a photo album.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff塞爾吉奧望著相簿，臉上浮現出寂寥而滿足的微笑。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffA gentle energy surrounds Sergio.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff一股溫柔的力量環繞著塞爾吉奧。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You are touched by seeing the satisfaction on Sergio's face.",
      "translation" : "看到塞爾吉奧滿足的神情，你深受感動。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sergio keeps looking at the photo album. Let's leave him alone.",
      "translation" : "塞爾吉奧仍在翻看相簿，先別打擾他吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You can talk to Sergio again when you pick up a new photo album from the Faceworm's Nest.",
      "translation" : "從驚駭森靈巢穴找到新的相簿後，可以再來與塞爾吉奧交談。"
    },
    {
