      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Are you at least level 140 yet?",
      "translation" : "你至少達到140級了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dol-Seoi]",
      "translation" : "[多爾索伊]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I used to be a servant to a very wealthy lady. She was always kind to me but she suffered from a severe cough that wouldn't go away unless she took a special pill.",
      "translation" : "我曾是一位富有女士的僕人。她總是待我很好，卻一直咳嗽不止，只有服用一種特殊藥丸才能緩解。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 183,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dol-Seoi]",
      "translation" : "[多爾索伊]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I used to get the pill from a group of armed-merchants but I heard that they were attacked by a snake and that's when I couldn't get any more pills.",
      "translation" : "我以前從一支武裝商團那裡買藥丸，但聽說他們遭到一條蛇襲擊，從那以後我就再也買不到藥了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dol-Seoi]",
      "translation" : "[多爾索伊]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I searched everywhere but no one could get that pill for me so eventually my lady passed away. If it wasn't for that slithering...",
      "translation" : "我到處尋找，卻沒人能弄到那種藥丸。最後，我的主人還是去世了。要不是那條蛇..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do you want to revenge?",
      "translation" : "你想復仇嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dol-Seoi]",
      "translation" : "[多爾索伊]"
